2.
Definitions.-
In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires:-
(a)
"Act" means the Pre-natal Diagnostic Techniques (Regulation and Prevention of Misuse) Act, 1994 (
57 of 1994
);
(b)
"Advisory Committee" means an Advisory Committee constituted under sub-section (5) of Section 17 of the Act;
(c)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Advisory Committee appointed under sub-section (5) of Section 17;
(d)
"Principle rules" means the Pre-natal Diagnostic Techniques (Regulation and Prevention of Misuse) Rules, 1996;
(e)
"section" means a section of the Act;
(f)
"words and expressions" used herein and not defined in these rules but defined in the Act or in the principal rules, as the
case may be, shall have the meanings, respectively, assigned to them in the Act or in the principle rules.
